  "chunks": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 10.5,
      "text": "Thirty thousand euros. Four community commitments. No plan that can satisfy them all. Common Ground makes that conflict visible, before anyone builds."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.5,
      "end": 19.55,
      "text": "Here, residents set the budget and minimums for shade, access, play and rain. These are illustrative design points, not measured impacts."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.55,
      "end": 28.4,
      "text": "The studio checks all four thousand and ninety-six combinations of twelve interventions. At thirty thousand, the commitments cannot all hold."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.4,
      "end": 38.15,
      "text": "Inspect the certificate: budget, shade, access and rain form an irreducible conflict. We could lower a target. Or change the budget."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.15,
      "end": 43.65,
      "text": "Seven thousand euros more preserves every original minimum. One plan survives."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.65,
      "end": 49.3,
      "text": "A grove of trees. An accessible loop. A wildflower patch. A table for everyone."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.3,
      "end": 55.35,
      "text": "The result is something you can take away. Export the proposal, then open the actual file."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.35,
      "end": 64.7,
      "text": "The reader reruns the full search. Costs, commitments and the selected plan agree. Change the saved result, and verification fails."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.7,
      "end": 72.121179,
      "text": "The next step is a real workshop, with local costs and residents. Common Ground. Make the compromise visible."
    }
  ],
